GLM tool-call parser overlay, in use on the reference service since 2026-09-06.

Base: sgl-project/sglang d6ab04bdf1, files under python/sglang/srt/function_call/.
Ports the brace and schema handling of sgl-project/sglang#36626 (merged) and
the closing-tag overlap repair of sgl-project/sglang#24147 (closed, not
merged). get_schema_properties reads tool properties inside anyOf, oneOf, and
allOf. The streaming fix keeps the longest buffered suffix that could begin
the closing tag, and tracks the first parameter explicitly because a trailing
brace may belong to a nested object value.
